{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>The anointed of his sons in his stead.</b> The anointed one of his sons in his stead." "<b>Wholly shall it be burned.</b> It is not scooped to have its remainder eaten, but all of it entirely; and so every meal-offering of a priest of a voluntary gift shall be in its entirety."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:14.678580345Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}